3
00:00:09.846 --> 00:00:16.410
U.S. sales tax is state-by-state, register with the Florida Department of Revenue before collecting sales tax in Florida.

4
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:23.339
Banking is a preparation game, bring complete documents, and start building U.S. credit as soon as your account opens.

5
00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:28.080
When you're ready, head back to your dashboard and choose your next module.
